   "source": [
    "# Relationship between classes\n",
    "- there are mainly two type of relationship\n",
    "- 1. Aggregation (has - a)\n",
    "- 2. Inheritance (Is - a )"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7ae3663b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Aggregation relationship\n",
    "- example:-\n",
    "- customer `has a` address\n",
    "- he `has a` book"
